flowchart TB
  accTitle: AI, retrieval and gaming workload data paths
  accDescr: All source-defined application deployments start at zero replicas and require qualification. Open WebUI calls SGLang; optional CPU embeddings and Chroma run inside WebUI. Qwen Code, DSH and Hermes run on the client, not in K3s. Gaming is optional and admission-blocked. PVC capacities are requests, not quotas.

  chat["Chat browser<br/>Private access must be configured"]
  agents["Client-side Qwen Code / DSH / Hermes<br/>Owner-authorized API port-forward"]
  player["Moonlight client<br/>Steam Remote Play is an alternative"]

  subgraph cluster["K3s · source view · PVC sizes are requests, not quotas"]
    ingress["Traefik<br/>DNS / TLS / external exposure gated"]
    subgraph namespace["ai-home-lab · replicas = 0 · qualify first · GPU workloads are not simultaneous allocations"]
      subgraph inference["AI chat and inference · logical group"]
        subgraph webuipod["Open WebUI deployment"]
          webui["Chat UI + backend<br/>TCP 8080"]
          rag["Opt-in RAG in the same container<br/>CPU embeddings + embedded Chroma<br/>No separate database service"]
        end
        sglang["SGLang · TCP 30000/v1<br/>Default overlay: 2 GPUs<br/>24 CPUs / 38 GiB host RAM"]
        model[("llm-models · 200 GiB RO<br/>sglang-hf-cache · 16 GiB")]
        chatdata[("Base webui-data · 20 GiB<br/>OR isolated RAG pilot claims<br/>20 GiB data + 3 GiB models RO")]
      end
      creative["SwarmUI + in-pod ComfyUI<br/>1 GPU · no allowed ingress yet"]
      gaming["Optional Steam Headless + Sunshine<br/>1 GPU per selected session<br/>Admission / input / exposure BLOCKED"]
      creativedata[("creative-models · 500 GiB<br/>Models / data / outputs")]
      gamedata[("Selected gaming-home · 500 GiB<br/>Games / shader cache / pairing")]

      webui -->|"OpenAI-compatible HTTP API"| sglang
      webui -.->|"optional overlay adds retrieval"| rag
      webui -->|"selected persistent data mount"| chatdata
      sglang -->|"read models / write caches"| model
      creative -->|"persistent files"| creativedata
      gaming -->|"persistent home"| gamedata
    end
    ingress -->|"NetworkPolicy allows WebUI only"| webui
  end

  chat -.->|"owner-configured HTTPS exposure"| ingress
  agents -->|"loopback tunnel via Kubernetes API · not Bridge"| sglang
  player -.->|"separate L4 streaming path · not Traefik"| gaming

  classDef storage fill:#e9f5ef,stroke:#39745a,color:#173c2c
  classDef gated fill:#fff7e6,stroke:#a56c12,color:#553609,stroke-dasharray:5 4
  class model,chatdata,creativedata,gamedata storage
  class rag,gaming,ingress,creative gated
